// RottenPotato Like Attack Pattern | T1557.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/security/account_management/win_security_susp_rottenpotato.yml
winlog.channel:Security AND (event.code:4624 AND winlog.event_data.LogonType:3 AND winlog.event_data.TargetUserName:"ANONYMOUS LOGON" AND source.domain:\- AND (source.ip:(127.0.0.1 OR \:\:1)))
